# SDAIA Academy Portal

Training portal: Next.js 16 + Supabase + Vercel (`bom1`). Repo root is `portal/`
only — never commit parent `_backups/` (PII).

## Before coding

Read `docs/CONTEXT.md` (includes 5 Aug 2026 branding / header / uploads).
Quizzes → also `docs/ASSESSMENTS.md` + `docs/DATA-MODEL.md`.
Deploy/region/cache → `DEPLOY.md`. Architecture → `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.

## Do not break

- RLS + `course_id`; helpers in `app_private.*`
- Answer keys only in `assessment_answer_keys`
- Quiz RPCs own timer / grading / integrity / import
- `revalidateCourseContent(courseId)` after content mutations
- `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` server-only; keep `vercel.json` regions `["bom1"]`
- Courses are 5 days; scores are quiz-only
- **Open redirect:** every login `next` must use `safeNext` in
  `src/app/actions/auth.ts`. Never `startsWith('/')` alone (`//evil.com` is bad)
- Day uploads: resolve MIME via `src/lib/course-files.ts` (never raw octet-stream)

## UI / chrome (current)

- Header: light surface + mosaic gradient; logo **right**; Profile → Notifications → Instructor
- Account menu for Edit info / Sign out (no direct avatar → profile)
- Soft `BackLink` on nested / auth / quiz pages
- Admin course tabs: **no** page fade; Assessments day tabs: instant switch, plain `Day N`
- Design: navy + teal, 1px borders, IBM Plex; brand logo `/sdaia-academy-logo.jpg`

## Conventions

- Server Actions thin; atomic logic in Postgres
- Students → `published.ts`. Instructors → live `queries.ts` / `quiz.ts`
- `'use server'` files export async functions only
- Prefer updating docs in the same change when behaviour drifts
- After `vercel --prod`, alias `sdaia-genai-portal.vercel.app`
